# 🛡️ API Error Handling

The API handles:

### Missing fields

Returns HTTP:

```text
400 Bad Request
```

### Invalid values

Returns:

```text
400 Bad Request
```

### Unexpected prediction errors

Returns:

```text
500 Internal Server Error
```

The API also logs errors and prediction requests for easier debugging.

